red so hence older kube version)\n```\nClient Version: v1.32.1\nKustomize Version: v5.5.0\nServer Version: v1.21.0+k3s1\n```\n\nSteps to reproduce\n\nUsing helm version v3.11.3\n\n```\nhelm upgrade test-app . --install --debug\n```\n\nthe following resource...note the older api version\n```\napiVersion: extensions/v1beta1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: minimal-ingress\n  labels:\n    env: \"dev\"\n  annotations:\n    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/rewrite-target: /\nspec:\n  ingressClassName: nginx-example\n  rules:\n  - http:\n      paths:\n      - path: /testpath\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          serviceName: test\n          servicePort: 80\n```\n\nUpgrade succeeds\n\nNow bump helm to v3.17.1\nhelm version\n```\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v3.17.1\", GitCommit:\"980d8ac1939e39138101364400756af2bdee1da5\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.23.5\"}\n```\n\nChange the resource api version of the resource\n\n```\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: minimal-ingress\n  labels:\n    env: \"dev\"\n  annotations:\n    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/rewrite-target: /\nspec:\n  ingressClassName: nginx-example\n  rules:\n  - http:\n      paths:\n      - path: /testpath\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          serviceName: test\n          servicePort: 80\n```\n\nRun the upgrade again\n\n```\nhelm upgrade test-app . --install --debug\n```\n\nResource is now deleted\n```\nhistory.go:56: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.222068 +0000 GMT m=+0.047340918 [debug] getting history for release test-app\nupgrade.go:164: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.26527 +0000 GMT m=+0.090542501 [debug] preparing upgrade for test-app\nupgrade.go:172: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.481671 +0000 GMT m=+0.306942710 [debug] performing update for test-app\nW0306 15:23:42.534549   55895 warnings.go:70] networking.k8s.io/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.19+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nupgrade.go:375: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.534623 +0000 GMT m=+0.359894876 [debug] creating upgraded release for test-app\nclient.go:393: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.611397 +0000 GMT m=+0.436667835 [debug] checking 1 resources for changes\nW0306 15:23:42.613388   55895 warnings.go:70] networking.k8s.io/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.19+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nW0306 15:23:42.615035   55895 warnings.go:70] networking.k8s.io/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.19+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nclient.go:692: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.616252 +0000 GMT m=+0.441523001 [debug] Looks like there are no changes for Ingress \"minimal-ingress\"\nW0306 15:23:42.617813   55895 warnings.go:70] networking.k8s.io/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.19+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nclient.go:442: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.617862 +0000 GMT m=+0.443133126 [debug] Deleting Ingress \"minimal-ingress\" in namespace default...\nW0306 15:23:42.619517   55895 warnings.go:70] extensions/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.14+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nW0306 15:23:42.623170   55895 warnings.go:70] extensions/v1beta1 Ingress is deprecated in v1.14+, unavailable in v1.22+; use networking.k8s.io/v1 Ingress\nupgrade.go:180: 2025-03-06 15:23:42.677571 +0000 GMT m=+0.502842126 [debug] updating status for upgraded release for test-app\n```\n\nI believe this is being caused by [this](https://github.com/helm/helm/commit/f5d488122b20374161c724ea1b1254ef628d02e3) change","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/30631/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/30631/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":17430309604,"node_id":"REFE_lADOApspmc6kvTU8zwAAAAQO7Wrk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/events/17430309604","actor":{